Phase 2: Login and Logout
Implement login and logout functionality.
Requirements:
3
• Users must be able to log in using their username and password.
• Verify the submitted password against the stored password hash.
• Create a server-side Session after successful login.
• Store the user's ID and username in the Session.
• Display the logged-in user's username on the main page.
• The user must remain logged in while the Session is valid in the same browser.
• When the user logs out, invalidate the Session.
Endpoints:
Method Endpoint Description
POST /login Log in
POST /logout Log out